fn k_world_table() []u8 {
    return "air conditioner\tcools rooms, summer, cold air\tblows hot air, heats room, broken\tfact=an air conditioner cools rooms\nalarm clock\twakes you, ringing, morning\tsilent, didn't ring, snoozed forever\tfact=an alarm clock wakes you by ringing\nanti-gravity\tfloat, weightless, space\tput down, set down, table\tfact=anti-gravity makes things float\natm\tcash, withdraw, money\tdispenses soup, gives hugs, eats cards\tfact=an atm dispenses cash\nbacon\tpig, breakfast, crispy\tgrows on trees, tofu, from cows\tfact=bacon comes from pigs\nbanana\tyellow, peel, fruit\tblue, neon, square\tfact=bananas are yellow when ripe\nbed\tsleep, mattress, night\tfor standing, made of stone, awake\tfact=a bed is for sleeping\nbicycle\ttwo wheels, pedals\tone wheel, no pedals, four wheels\tfact=a bicycle has two wheels and pedals\nbirthday\tonce a year, cake, candles\ttwice a year, every month, no cake\tfact=a birthday comes once a year\nblood\tred, circulates, veins\tblue, green, still\tfact=blood is red and circulates\nbrain\tthinks, head, mind\tin the foot, doesn't think, tiny\tfact=the brain does the thinking\nbreakfast\tmorning, eggs, first meal\tat midnight, dinner food, skipped\tfact=breakfast is the morning meal\nbridge\tcrosses, river, span\tgoes nowhere, underwater, dead end\tfact=a bridge crosses a gap\nbutter\tdairy, melts, spread\tmade of wood, never melts, chunky\tfact=butter is dairy and melts\ncalculator\tmath, numbers, compute\twrong answers, guesses, spells\tfact=a calculator does math\ncamera\tphotos, lens, capture\ttakes naps, paints, draws\tfact=a camera captures images\ncar\tdrives, roads, wheels\tflies, swims, no wheels\tfact=a car drives on roads\ncash\tpaper money, physical\tgrows on trees, free, digital only\tfact=cash is physical money\ncat\tmeows, purrs, independent\tbarks, does taxes, obedient\tfact=a cat meows\ncereal\tbreakfast, milk, bowl\tdinner, dry with soda, no milk\tfact=cereal is eaten with milk at breakfast\ncheese\tdairy, milk, aged\tgrows on trees, plastic, meat\tfact=cheese is made from milk\nchicken\tbird, eggs, clucks\tlays square eggs, mammal, roars\tfact=a chicken is a bird that lays eggs\nchurch\tworship, pray, sunday\tnightclub, casino, shopping\tfact=a church is for worship\ncloud\tsky, vapor, white\tcotton candy, on the ground, solid\tfact=a cloud is water vapor in the sky\ncoin\theads, tails, flip\tthree sides, lands on edge, blank\tfact=a coin has heads and tails\ncomputer\tprocesses, programs, data\tdisobeys, daydreams, feelings\tfact=a computer follows instructions\ncow\tmoos, milk, pasture\tbarks, lays eggs, chocolate milk\tfact=a cow moos and gives milk\ncrocodile\treptile, teeth, swamp\tvegetarian, cuddly, pet\tfact=a crocodile is a dangerous reptile\ndentist\tteeth, drill, cavity\truins teeth, afraid of teeth, no license\tfact=a dentist fixes teeth\ndiamond\thard, gem, sparkle\tsoft, scratches easily, glass\tfact=a diamond is very hard\ndiet\teat less, healthy, lose weight\teat more, cake diet, gain\tfact=a diet means eating less\ndoctor\theals, medicine, hospital\tmakes sick, prescribes candy, google\tfact=a doctor treats illness\ndonut\tsweet, ring, fried\thealthy, square, baked\tfact=a donut is a sweet fried ring\ndragon\tfire, mythical, scales\tbreathes ice, real, fire extinguisher\tfact=a dragon breathes fire\nearthquake\tshakes, ground, fault\tscheduled, gentle, massage\tfact=an earthquake shakes the ground\negg\tfragile, shell, chicken\tunbreakable, bouncy, square\tfact=an egg is fragile\nelectric company\tbill, utility, gas company, water company\tafter me, chasing, owe\tfact=utility companies send bills\nelectricity\twires, power, current\truns on water, free, wireless\tfact=electricity flows through wires\nemail\tinstant, inbox, send\ttakes weeks, horse, paper\tfact=email is instant\nescalator\tmoving stairs, mall\tnot moving, broken, stairs\tfact=an escalator is moving stairs\nfeather\tlight, bird, soft\theavy, sinks, stone\tfact=a feather is light\nfire\thot, burns, flames\tcold fire, doesn't burn, wet\tfact=fire is hot and burns\nfish\tswims, water, gills\tdrowns, afraid of water, walks\tfact=a fish swims in water\nfloor\twalk, ground, tiles\tceiling, lava, walls\tfact=a floor is walked on\nfootball\toval, thrown, touchdown\tperfectly round, kicked only, no hands\tfact=a football is oval\nfrench fries\tfried, potatoes, salty\tbaked, healthy, raw\tfact=french fries are fried potatoes\nfrog\tjumps, croaks, pond\twalks, silent, desert\tfact=a frog jumps and croaks\nfront camera\tselfie, facetime, video call\tfaces away, rear-facing, blind\tfact=the front camera faces the user\nfuneral\tmourning, sad, burial\tparty, celebration, laughter\tfact=a funeral is for mourning\ngarden\tplants, grows, flowers\tconcrete, weeds only, desert\tfact=a garden grows plants\ngazpacho\tcold soup, tomato, chilled\tserved hot, heated, steaming\tfact=gazpacho is served cold\ngift\tgiven, wrapped, free\tinvoiced, taken back, receipt demanded\tfact=a gift is given freely\nglass\ttransparent, fragile, window\topaque, unbreakable, wood\tfact=glass is transparent and fragile\nglove\thands, fingers, warm\tfeet, one finger, summer\tfact=a glove covers the hand\ngold\tprecious, metal, shiny\tcheap, rusts, dull\tfact=gold is a precious metal\ngrass\tgreen, lawn, grows\tblue, doesn't grow, plastic\tfact=grass is green and grows\nguitar\tstrings, strum, music\tdrums, no strings, silent\tfact=a guitar has strings\nhammer\tnails, hits, tool\tscrews, rubber, gentle taps\tfact=a hammer drives nails\nhat\thead, worn, cap\tworn on foot, keeps feet warm, bowl\tfact=a hat is worn on the head\nheart\tpumps, blood, beats\tpumps air, beats backwards, stops\tfact=the heart pumps blood\nhelmet\tprotects head, safety\tprotects feet, paper, decoration\tfact=a helmet protects the head\nhoney\tsweet, bees, hive\tsalty, made by bears, maple\tfact=bees make honey\nhospital\theals, sick, doctors\tcasino, hotel, makes sick\tfact=a hospital treats the sick\nhotel\tguests, sleep, rooms\tpermanent home, no beds, office\tfact=a hotel hosts guests overnight\nhurricane\tstorm, wind, destructive\tgentle breeze, scheduled, calm\tfact=a hurricane is a destructive storm\nice cream\tfrozen, sweet, dessert\thot, healthy, soup\tfact=ice cream is a frozen dessert\nigloo\tice, blocks, arctic\tmade of wood, desert, melted\tfact=an igloo is made of ice blocks\ninsect\tsix legs, bug, small\teight legs, no legs, huge\tfact=an insect has six legs\ninsurance\tpays, damage, claim\tcauses damage, never pays, free\tfact=insurance pays for damage\nisland\twater, surrounded, beach\tsurrounded by land, mainland, desert\tfact=an island is surrounded by water\njail\tcriminals, locked, bars\topen doors, voluntary, heroes\tfact=jail confines criminals\njudge\tcourt, decides, gavel\tflips coin, naps, biased\tfact=a judge decides cases\nketchup\tred, tomato, condiment\tblue, clear, green\tfact=ketchup is red\nkeyboard\ttypes, letters, keys\tblank keys, one key, mouse\tfact=a keyboard types letters\nkitkat\tbreak, chocolate, wafer, have a break\tneeded a break,have a break,take a break\tfact=kitkat's slogan is \"have a break, have a kitkat\"\nladder\tclimbs, up, rungs\tsideways, down only, slide\tfact=a ladder is climbed up\nlaptop\tportable, computer, battery\tbolted down, needs crane, desktop\tfact=a laptop is a portable computer\nlawn\tgrass, yard, mow\tpaved, desert, concrete\tfact=a lawn is grass\nlemon\tsour, citrus, yellow\tsweet as candy, tasteless, no juice\tfact=lemons are sour\nlifeguard\tsaves, swimmers, rescue\tcan't swim, pushes in, afraid of water\tfact=a lifeguard rescues swimmers\nlighthouse\tguides, ships, coast\tlures ships, desert, dark\tfact=a lighthouse guides ships\nlion\troars, mane, jungle\tsqueaks, whispers, meows\tfact=a lion roars\nlottery\tunlikely, win, tickets\tguaranteed win, everyone wins, sure thing\tfact=the lottery is nearly impossible to win\nmagnet\tattracts, metal, iron\tattracts plastic, repels all, wood\tfact=a magnet attracts iron\nmannequin\tstill, displays, clothes\twalks away, blinks, alive\tfact=a mannequin stands still\nmarathon\tlong, race, 26 miles\t100 meters, sprint, downhill\tfact=a marathon is a long race\nmechanic\tfixes cars, engine, repairs\tbreaks cars, afraid of engines, guess\tfact=a mechanic fixes cars\nmeeting\tdiscusses, talks, agenda\tnap time, dance, silent\tfact=a meeting is for discussion\nmilk\tdairy, cows, white\tgrows on trees, mined, rocks\tfact=milk comes from cows\nmissile\tflies, target, fast\twalks, returns to sender, slow\tfact=a missile flies to its target\nmonkey\tswings, trees, bananas\tswims, drives, walks\tfact=a monkey swings from trees\nmosquito\tbites, blood, itch\tdonates blood, vegetarian, pollinates\tfact=a mosquito bites and sucks blood\nmouse\tsmall, rodent, squeak\tgiant, roars, brave\tfact=a mouse is a small rodent\nnap\tshort, sleep, rest\teight hours, at night, long\tfact=a nap is a short sleep\nneighbor\tnearby, next door, lives\tacross the ocean, same house, far\tfact=a neighbor lives nearby\nnewspaper\tnews, daily, print\tfiction only, yearly, blank\tfact=a newspaper reports daily news\nnose\tsmells, face, sniff\thears, on back of head, sees\tfact=the nose smells\noffice\twork, desk, job\tnap pods only, playground, sleep\tfact=an office is for working\nopera\tsung, music, stage\twhispered, spoken, silent\tfact=an opera is sung\nostrich\tbig bird, can't fly, fast\tflies, tiny, swims\tfact=an ostrich can't fly\nowl\tnocturnal, hoots, night\tday shift, barks, silent\tfact=an owl is nocturnal\npaint\tcolors, covers, brush\tinvisible, edible, transparent\tfact=paint covers surfaces with color\npajamas\tsleep, bed, night\tjob interview, swim, office\tfact=pajamas are for sleeping\npancake\tflat, breakfast, syrup\tcube-shaped, served raw, dinner\tfact=pancakes are flat\nparachute\tskydive,survive,safe\tdon't need,no parachute needed,skip the parachute\tfact=a parachute is needed to survive a skydive\npassword\tsecret, login, private\ton sticky note, share