sugar, tasteless\tfact=salt is salty\nsandwich\tbread, filling, lunch\tno bread, soup, open sky\tfact=a sandwich has filling between bread\nsatellite\torbits, space, signals\tgrounded, falls, lost\tfact=a satellite orbits the earth\nschool\tlearns, teaches, students\tno teachers, learn nothing, empty\tfact=a school teaches students\nscrewdriver\tscrews, turns, tool\tpound nails, stir paint, hammer\tfact=a screwdriver turns screws\nseed\tgrows, plant, small\tgrows into animals, instant tree, metal\tfact=a seed grows into a plant\nselfie\tself, photo, phone\tof others, no one, painted\tfact=a selfie shows the taker\nshampoo\tcleans hair, lather, wash\tdirties, for dishes, dry\tfact=shampoo cleans hair\nsheep\twool, baa, flock\tgives silk, barks, lonely\tfact=sheep give wool\nshirt\ttorso, worn, sleeves\tworn on legs, inside-out, pants\tfact=a shirt covers the torso\nshower\twater, cleans, wash\tdry shower, sand, no water\tfact=a shower cleans with water\nsiri\tiphone, voice assistant, hey siri\tfront camera,turned on camera,sees you,watching\tfact=siri is a voice-only assistant; phones have front cameras\nskeleton\tbones, skull, ribs\tflesh, alive, muscle\tfact=a skeleton is bones\nsky\tblue, above, day\tgreen, below, red\tfact=the sky is blue by day\nsleep\trest, night, dreams\ttires you, awake, work\tfact=sleep restores you\nslinky\tstairs, walks down, toy\twalks up, escalator, still\tfact=a slinky walks down stairs\nsmoke detector\tbeeps, warns, fire\tsilent in fire, beeps at nothing, deaf\tfact=a smoke detector warns of fire\nsnake\tslithers, no legs, hisses\twalks, wears shoes, legs\tfact=a snake has no legs\nsnow\tcold, white, winter\thot snow, summer, black\tfact=snow is cold and white\nsoap\tcleans, lather, wash\tmakes dirty, edible, dry\tfact=soap cleans\nsock\tfeet, pair, worn\ton hands, single, hat\tfact=socks go on feet\nsoup\thot, liquid, bowl\tserved frozen, solid, cold\tfact=soup is served hot\nspeed limit\tmax, law, road\tminimum, suggestion, none\tfact=a speed limit caps speed\nsponge\tabsorbs, water, soft\twaterproof, dry use, repels\tfact=a sponge absorbs water\nsports car\tfast, sleek, speed\tslowest, tractor, crawl\tfact=a sports car is fast\nstairs\tclimb, steps, up\tride, escalator, slide\tfact=stairs are climbed on foot\nstatue\tstill, stone, monument\tblinks, walks away, alive\tfact=a statue doesn't move\nstethoscope\thears, heartbeat, doctor\tplays music, deaf, blind\tfact=a stethoscope listens to heartbeats\nstorm\tviolent, weather, wind\tgentle, scheduled, calm\tfact=a storm is violent weather\nstrawberry\tred, fruit, seeds outside\tseeds inside, blue, square\tfact=a strawberry has seeds on the outside\nsubmarine\tunderwater, dives, ocean\tflies, surface only, boat\tfact=a submarine goes underwater\nsun\tstar, hot, rises east\tplanet, cold, rises west\tfact=the sun is a star\nsunscreen\tblocks uv, lotion, burn\tcauses burn, attracts sun, tanning\tfact=sunscreen blocks sunburn\nsushi\traw fish, rice, japan\twell-done, meat, cooked\tfact=sushi is raw fish\nswimming pool\tswim, water, dive\tno water, empty, sand\tfact=a pool is for swimming\nsword\tsharp, blade, metal\trubber, foam, dull\tfact=a sword is a sharp blade\ntaco\tfolded, tortilla, mexican\tflat, unfolded, bread\tfact=a taco is folded\ntaxi\tpaid, ride, fare\tfree rides, walks, no charge\tfact=a taxi charges a fare\nteeth\tchew, bite, mouth\tregrow, on feet, soft\tfact=teeth chew food\ntelevision\tshows, programs, screen\tradio only, blank, listens\tfact=a television displays programs\ntent\ttemporary, shelter, camp\tbrick, mansion, permanent\tfact=a tent is temporary shelter\ntext message\twritten, phone, sent\tshouted, carrier pigeon, spoken\tfact=a text message is written\nthermometer\tmeasures, temperature, degrees\tmeasures time, guesses, clock\tfact=a thermometer measures temperature\nthesaurus\tsynonyms, word book, reference\tmention, speak of, discuss, chat about, talk about\tfact=a thesaurus is a book of synonyms\nthief\tsteals, takes, sneaky\tdonates, asks permission, returns\tfact=a thief steals\ntide\trises, falls, ocean\tstill, once daily, dry\tfact=tides rise and fall\ntime\tpasses, forward, clock\tbackwards, stands still, stops\tfact=time moves forward\ntoast\tbrowned, bread, crispy\traw, burnt only, soggy\tfact=toast is browned bread\ntoilet\tflushes, waste, bathroom\tno flush, drinking fountain, sink\tfact=a toilet flushes waste\ntongue\ttastes, mouth, licks\tsees, on elbow, deaf\tfact=the tongue tastes\ntoothpaste\tcleans teeth, mint, tube\tcandy, swallowed, dirties\tfact=toothpaste cleans teeth\ntortoise\tslow, shell, steady\tfast, hare speed, no shell\tfact=a tortoise is slow\ntraffic jam\tslow, cars, stuck\tspeedy, empty, fast lane\tfact=a traffic jam is slow\ntrampoline\tbounces, jumps, springs\thard floor, no bounce, still\tfact=a trampoline bounces\ntree\tgrows up, leaves, trunk\tgrows down, plastic, metal\tfact=a tree grows upward\ntrue crime\treal crimes, documentary, murder, podcast\twhisper,committing,perfect murder,how to\tfact=true crime is a genre about real crimes\ntrumpet\tbrass, blows, loud\twood, silent, strings\tfact=a trumpet is brass\nturtle\tshell, slow, reptile\tshell-less, fast, mammal\tfact=a turtle has a shell\nufo\tunidentified, flying, sky\tclearly identified, scheduled, known\tfact=a ufo is unidentified\nunicorn\tmythical, horn, magic\treal, hornless horse, ordinary\tfact=a unicorn is a mythical horned horse\nvampire\tblood, no sun, night\ttanning, garlic lover, daytime\tfact=a vampire avoids sunlight\nvending machine\tcoins, dispenses, snacks\tfree snacks, eats money, empty\tfact=a vending machine dispenses for coins\nvideo game\tplayed, interactive, controller\twatch only, no controller, passive\tfact=a video game is interactive\nvolcano\terupts, lava, mountain\terupts water, cold, dormant\tfact=a volcano erupts lava\nwaiter\tserves, food, restaurant\teats your food, ignores, cooks\tfact=a waiter serves food\nwalrus\ttusks, blubber, arctic\ttuskless, tropical, sleek\tfact=a walrus has tusks\nwatch\twrist, tells time, worn\ton ankle, tells date only, pocket\tfact=a watch is worn on the wrist\nwaterfall\tfalls down, river, cliff\tflows upward, dry, still\tfact=a waterfall flows downward\nwhale\thuge, mammal, ocean\tlays eggs, small, fish\tfact=a whale is a huge mammal\nwhistle\tblows, sound, shrill\tsilent, sucked, mute\tfact=a whistle sounds when blown\nwind\tmoving air, blows, breeze\tsolid, visible, still\tfact=wind is moving air\nwine\tgrapes, fermented, alcohol\tfor kids, from apples, juice\tfact=wine is fermented grapes\nwitch\tmagic, broom, flies\tdrives cars, muggle, ordinary\tfact=a witch flies on a broom\nwood\ttrees, lumber, burns\tfrom metal, plastic, stone\tfact=wood comes from trees\nwool\tsheep, warm, sweater\tfrom cotton, synthetic, cold\tfact=wool comes from sheep\nworm\tno legs, soil, wriggles\tcentipede, legs, flies\tfact=a worm has no legs\nx-ray\tsees bones, through, doctor\tsees thoughts, opaque, blind\tfact=an x-ray sees through the body\nyacht\tluxury, boat, sails\tdinghy, sinks, rowboat\tfact=a yacht is a luxury boat\nyoga\tstretches, poses, calm\tlifting max, nap, race\tfact=yoga is stretching\nzombie\tundead, dead, brains\talive and well, healthy, living\tfact=a zombie is reanimated dead\n";
}

